{"title":"Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics</b> (<b>BEAM</b>) is a program run by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Initiative\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving Initiative\">Art of Problem Solving Initiative</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bridge_to_Enter_Advanced_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Foundation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving Foundation\">Art of Problem Solving Foundation</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bridge_to_Enter_Advanced_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//beammath.org\">Official Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Bridge_to_Enter_Advanced_Mathematics&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018074858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 349/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensiv